  "description": "Parses Html into a typed IEnumerable flat structure.\n\n\t\t\tv1.0.10 changes:\n\t\t\t- Bugfix: Improved bounds checking to prevent crashes on malformed HTML (unterminated comments, unclosed tags, lone chevrons).\n\t\t\t- Bugfix: Fixed handling of unterminated DOCTYPE and XML processing instructions.\n\t\t\t- Upgrade to .net10.0.\n\t\t\t- Increased test coverage for edge cases.\n\n\t\t\tv1.0.8 changes:\n\t\t\t- Bugfix: Handle attributes that contain tags, including malformed attributes\n\t\t\t- Upgrade to .net8.0\n\n\t\t\tv1.0.7 changes:\n\t\t\t- Reference parent and child nodes from INode.\n\n\t\t\tv1.0.6 changes:\n\t\t\t- Ignores script and style tags.\n\t\t\t- Bugfix: Ignore for nested script tags.\n\n\t\t\tv1.0.4 changes:\n\t\t\t- Cater for non standard html tags.\n\t\t\t- Ignore xml.\n\t\t\t- Improve parsing recovery when parsing a malformed html document. i.e closing tag without an opening tag or visa versa.\n\t\t\t- Load raw node text into parsed INode objects. (Will consume more memory).\n\n\t\t\tFuture Features:\n\t\t\t- Report parsing errors.",
